OL,3,GNEWSATeenager arrested over death of
OL,4,A21-year-old in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested over the
OL,7,Fdeath of a man after a disturbance in
OL,8,FGlasgow city centre.
OL,10,FDaniel Colrain, 21, was found with
OL,11,Fserious injuries in Royal Exchange
OL,12,FSquare at about 03:05 on Sunday. He
OL,13,Fdied in hospital the following day.
OL,15,FPolice Scotland said a 19-year-old man
OL,16,Fhad been arrested in connection with
OL,17,Fthe death and inquiries were ongoing.
OL,19,FA second 19-year-old man was previously
OL,20,Farrested in connection with the
OL,21,Fdisturbance and released pending
OL,22,Ffurther investigation.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
